WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:07.640
What?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.300
Cameraman: We're live!

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.160
Cordon: Welcome to another exciting episode of The Wokking Dead.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.320
I'm your host, Cordon Gruesome.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.320
But only for today, because I've been fired.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.940
Our new host couldn't start until next week, so this is my last show.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.440
Today's episode is brought to you by Culinart Productions,

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.400
putting the crap in craft services.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.120
Dave: I heard that.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:50.980
Cordon: Oh yeah! Well I heard your wife left you for a baboon at the zoo!

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.900
WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD!!!!!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.140
WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD!

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:06.420
THE WOKKING DEAD!!!

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.280
WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD!!!!!!!!!!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.700
On today's episode of The Wokking Dead,

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:19.520
We'll be taking a request from a user named BryceMakesFilms.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.040
He writes:

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.980
"Hey Cordon. I'm turning 21 next year.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:28.560
Have any recipes for drinks I should try?"

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:33.860
Well Bryce, lucky for you, I've got just the thing.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.100
First, start by preheating the over...

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.100
Heh! Over...

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:41.660
THE OVEN.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.820
To 500°.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.380
Dave: Hold on Cordon. What do you need the oven for?

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.280
Cordon: Get in there!

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.080
Dave: Security please!

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.680
Cordon: Oh! AGGGHHHH--

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.780
And here's what you'll need.

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:58.180
Schnapps.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:01:59.880
Irish Cream.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.960
And grenaldyine.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:03.900
Dave: It's Grenadine.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.480
Cordon: Grenadine.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.620
And since I really needed this job, Arsenic.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.280
Cordon: What the? Give me that.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:14.720
DAGHHH--

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.540
And the first thing for you to do,

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:21.460
is to open the bottle schnapps

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:23.680
like this.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:40.840
*burp*

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:43.680
And if you run out,

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.040
you can just get more,

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:48.620
and put it on the company card.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.440
Dave: Give me that!
Cordon: No!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.500
Cordon: You're a dick Dave!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.280
Put EXACTLY one ounce

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.280
Into the glass.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:05.660
I forgot.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.080
*ringtone*

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.860
Oh, this is important.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.820
Hold on a second.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:15.900
Hello?

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.640
And then I said,

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.600
you can forget about your Grandma's orange juice,

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.880
because I'm not coming back.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.540
And then I slammed the door.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.220
Dave: Cordon!

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.780
Cordon: Can't you see that I'm on the phone?

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.180
Dave: Just finish the show already.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:38.600
Cordon: I'll call you back.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.700
Where was I?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.940
Oh yeah. Irish Cream.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.000
You put in 1 z-spoon.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.200
Cordon: Bethany you bitch!

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:59.860
We could have been on top of the world together.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:03.440
*burp*

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.520
Dave: Here we go again...

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:13.220
Cordon: But you had to go off with the querulous surfer boy with the timeless bagel...

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.520
Dave: What does that even mean?

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:18.820
Cordon: I'll show her. I'll show all of you!

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.640
Just wait...

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.620
Cordon: Why are all the clouds purple?

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.900
Dave: We are inside Cordon!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.540
So finally...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.480
the last ingredient,

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.180
is 1/2 z-spoon of Geraldine.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.380
Dave: You're telling me we only had to pour three ingredients into a cup?

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:58.680
Cordon: These actually look pretty good!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.340
Dave: Cordon, I think you've had enough, alright?

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.680
Why don't you just take us out?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:09.760
Welcome to another episode of The Wokking Dead.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:11.740
This week--

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.240
Dave: The other one!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.280
Cordon: Thanks for Wokking the watching Dead!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.340
Remember...

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.680
suscribe for your own kitchen.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:24.120
Dave: Well...

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.120
Get him out of here!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.640
I'm sorry for Cordon's behaviour,

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.560
but join us next time as we introduce a new host.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.100
I hope to see you then!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.540
There's no way we can present this to our viewers. It's completely unprofessional.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.940
CZ: Look. We have to upload an episode every month.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.620
That's what the fans expect.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:51.400
Dave: The first three... they were pretty disasterous, but there was something there.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.580
This? It's complete anarchy. You can't upload it.

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:58.360
CZ: You are obligated to deliver an episode every month.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:05:59.840
Doesn't really matter what's in it.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:01.460
Nobody'll notice.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.060
Probably.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.160
Dave: Did you even see that abomination?

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:11.680
CZ: I don't know. If you'll excuse me, I have some "business" to attend to...

